{"provider":"github","id":"7276","externalId":"5819175462","revision":"2026-10-12T19:45:16Z","type":"issue","title":"gagglehealth journal Append failure can leave a torn or duplicate-sequence record, making the store unopenable","body":"## Problem\ngagglehealth journal Append failure can leave a torn or duplicate-sequence record, making the store unopenable\n\n**Location:** internal/gagglehealth/store.go: Store.Append, appendEvent, readEvents\n\n## Evidence\nappendEvent writes then syncs; on error s.events is not updated, so a retry reuses the same sequence. Reopen then fails with \"journal sequence is not strictly increasing\", or a torn line fails to decode.\n12\n\n## Proposed scope\nMake a failed append leave the journal recoverable (truncate/roll back the partial record or advance the sequence consistently) and make Open tolerate or repair a torn trailing line.\n\n## Acceptance sketch\n- Deterministic tests in the same package cover the behaviour; `go test` for the package passes.\n\nCategory: reliability\nConfidence: high; lens(es): 10 (quality-sprint collated findings)\n\nNomination key: qs/11\n","labels":["area:runner","goobers:approved","goobers:ready","goobers:claimed","goobers:nominated","type:bug","goobers:cloud"],"state":"open","status":"open","links":[{"rel":"self","url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7276"}],"url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7276","createdAt":"2026-10-12T19:17:20Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-12T19:45:16Z","readyAt":"2026-10-12T19:40:56Z","fields":{"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-12T19:17:20Z","id":5819175462,"issue_dependencies_summary.total_blocked_by":0,"locked":false,"number":7276,"state":"open","title":"gagglehealth journal Append failure can leave a torn or duplicate-sequence record, making the store unopenable","updated_at":"2026-10-12T19:45:16Z","user.login":"goobersbot[bot]"},"raw":{"id":5819175462,"number":7276,"title":"gagglehealth journal Append failure can leave a torn or duplicate-sequence record, making the store unopenable","body":"## Problem\ngagglehealth journal Append failure can leave a torn or duplicate-sequence record, making the store unopenable\n\n**Location:** internal/gagglehealth/store.go: Store.Append, appendEvent, readEvents\n\n## Evidence\nappendEvent writes then syncs; on error s.events is not updated, so a retry reuses the same sequence. Reopen then fails with \"journal sequence is not strictly increasing\", or a torn line fails to decode.\n12\n\n## Proposed scope\nMake a failed append leave the journal recoverable (truncate/roll back the partial record or advance the sequence consistently) and make Open tolerate or repair a torn trailing line.\n\n## Acceptance sketch\n- Deterministic tests in the same package cover the behaviour; `go test` for the package passes.\n\nCategory: reliability\nConfidence: high; lens(es): 10 (quality-sprint collated findings)\n\nNomination key: qs/11\n","state":"open","state_reason":"","locked":false,"comments":4,"html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7276","user":{"login":"goobersbot[bot]","type":"Bot"},"labels":[{"name":"area:runner","color":"1d76db","description":"Local runner: lifecycle, scheduler, stages, CLI"},{"name":"goobers:approved","color":"0E8A16","description":"Maintainer-approved — eligible for curation/implementation (SEC-047)"},{"name":"goobers:ready","color":"1D76DB","description":"Curated and scoped — eligible for implementation"},{"name":"goobers:claimed","color":"FBCA04","description":"Currently claimed by an in-flight run"},{"name":"goobers:nominated","color":"5319E7","description":"Filed by the nominator — awaiting maintainer approval"},{"name":"type:bug","color":"D73A4A","description":"Defect in existing behavior"},{"name":"goobers:cloud","color":"1d76db","description":"Claim-partition: issue belongs to the cloud (Goobernetes) instance"}],"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"created_at":"2026-10-12T19:17:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T19:45:16Z","issue_dependencies_summary":{"total_blocked_by":0},"pull_request":null},"integrity":"maintainer"}